730
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:34,599
Eh! Dah masa tu ke?

731
00:40:34,622 --> 00:40:39,640
Betul, masa berlalu dengan cepat.

732
00:40:39,664 --> 00:40:43,997
Kereta api terakhir awak pukul berapa?

733
00:40:44,020 --> 00:40:48,987
Kereta api terakhir saya pukul 11:45.

734
00:40:49,010 --> 00:40:53,693
Kereta api terakhir saya pukul 11:30!

735
00:40:53,716 --> 00:40:57,089
Dah tinggal 15 minit je!

736
00:40:57,112 --> 00:40:59,746
