744
00:41:23,775 --> 00:41:27,908
Saya akan bayar dulu, awak boleh pergi dulu.

745
00:41:27,931 --> 00:41:31,774
Eh, macam tu tak baik pula!

746
00:41:31,797 --> 00:41:35,174
Nanti bayar balik melalui LINE ya.

