755
00:41:54,959 --> 00:41:58,736
Hari ini sangat seronok!

756
00:41:58,759 --> 00:42:00,537
Terima kasih!

757
00:42:00,561 --> 00:42:03,427
Saya juga seronok.

758
00:42:03,450 --> 00:42:06,017
Beri tahu saya bila sudah sampai, ya.

759
00:42:06,040 --> 00:42:08,286
Baiklah.

760
00:42:08,309 --> 00:42:11,676
Nanti saya hantar mesej LINE bila sudah selamat naik kereta.

761
00:42:11,699 --> 00:42:14,432
Hati-hati dalam perjalanan pulang, ya.

762
00:42:14,455 --> 00:42:17,267
