Anginnya terasa nyaman.

776
00:42:50,453 --> 00:42:52,820
Sedapnya makanan tadi, kan?

777
00:42:52,843 --> 00:42:56,293
Perut sudah kenyang.

778
00:42:56,316 --> 00:42:59,849
Masih belum pukul 10 lagi, loh.

779
00:42:59,872 --> 00:43:02,125
Cepatnya!

780
00:43:02,149 --> 00:43:04,749
Memang betul.

781
